Hi, since you want your fill as part of your canvas, you should declare it within the aesthetics:

library(ggplot2)
data <- read.csv("sample.csv")
p1 <- ggplot(data, aes(x,y, fill=value))
p1 + geom_tile()

or:
p1 <- p1 + geom_tile()
p1

if you really wanted to.

Cheers,

Richard

